  "notes": "Cream apartment/synagogue building, 3 floors, flat roof. A grey Star-of-David relief motif and small square vent windows decorate the upper facade; balconies with glass rails; a small gabled entrance canopy shelters the recessed entry door and metal-bar gate. Frontage: rubble-stone-clad garden wall carrying framed mosaic murals, planters, wooden fence section, palms and a printed recycling bin. Environment added 2026-07-05 from scene ref: green hedge over the left wall, two tall palms, two big round oaks, banana-like garden bushes by the gate, two grass planters on the sidewalk, a printed recycling bin and a single silver car parked at the right kerb. Colours sampled from ref 2026-07-04."
